    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      260.75,
      451.21,
      298.41
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends the long title to the Sri Lanka Land Reclamation andDevelopment Corporation Act, No. 15 of 1968 and the legal effect of that section is tochange the name of the \u201cSri Lanka Land Reclamation and Development Corporation\u201d to\u201cSri Lanka Land Development Corporation\u201d.",
